.Wrap(err, \"failed to start transaction\")\n\t\t}\n\t\tdefer tx.Rollback()\n\t\tslog.Info(\"initializing new database with latest schema\", slog.String(\"file\", filePath))\n\t\tif err := s.execute(ctx, tx, string(bytes)); err != nil {\n\t\t\treturn errors.Errorf(\"failed to execute SQL file %s, err %s\", filePath, err)\n\t\t}\n```\n\nFor a SQLite deployment (`s.profile.Driver == \"sqlite\"`), `getMigrationBasePath()` returns `migration/sqlite/`, so the file loaded is `store/migration/sqlite/LATEST.sql`, which contains all `CREATE TABLE` statements for the current schema (verified its contents start with `system_setting`, `user`, `user_setting`, etc.)."}}}],"userMessage":{"text":"Answer the SINGLE question below about this repository. Cite file paths. If you cannot determine the answer, say so rather than guessing.\nStart your answer with a line reading exactly \"q10.\"\n\nQuestion q10:\nFor a fresh SQLite install, which single file provides the complete current schema?\nAnswer format: path","messageId":"","mode":0,"conversationStateBlobId":{"0":145,"1":175,"2":98,"3":167,"4":5,"5":145,"6":130,"7":203,"8":9,"9":245,"10":88,"11":126,"12":188,"13":176,"14":26,"15":22,"16":153,"17":225,"18":173,"19":2,"20":200,"21":47,"22":57,"23":17,"24":192,"25":73,"26":78,"27":26,"28":219,"29":154,"30":34,"31":24},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"selectedContext":{"selectedImages":[],"extraContext":[],"extraContextEntries":[],"files":[],"codeSelections":[],"terminals":[],"terminalSelections":[],"folders":[],"externalLinks":[],"cursorRules":[],"cursorCommands":[],"documentations":[],"uiElements":[],"consoleLogs":[],"gitCommits":[],"pastChats":[],"gitPrDiffSelections":[],"selectedPullRequests":[],"selectedSubagents":[],"selectedVideos":[],"selectedBrowsers":[],"selectedDocuments":[],"selectedSkills":[]}}}}}}]}